  ['Accept a reference sequence (D1)', 'The report proposes a sequence that is not a type, such as material identified by the authors, as a name’s reference.', 'Accept or reject, with your reason.', 'One'],
  ['Types ITS cannot tell apart (D3)', 'The type sequences of two or more names do not differ on the part of ITS they share.', 'Published synonymy (give the citation), “distinct but unresolved on ITS”, or “needs full ITS of the types”.', 'Two'],
  ['Possible misapplied name (D4)', 'Records deposited under one name match the reference sequence of another.', 'A misapplied name (the pattern is labelled), a synonym, “the reference sequence is wrong or too short”, or “unresolved”.', 'Two'],
